[statement]
As `repositories/a-record-with-the-identity-of-a-record-apk-cannot-install-is-that-record`,
the record apk cannot install installed: the root holds `a` with a field
apk does not know, a repository offers `a` with its identity, and apk
refuses the world's `a`, though the repository's record alone it could
install.

[repository]
C:Q1AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=
P:a
V:1

P:x
V:1

[installed]
C:Q1AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=
P:a
V:1
X:strange

[world]
a

[request]
x

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| WARNING: This apk-tools is OLD! Some packages are not installable.
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   a-1:
|     error: uninstallable
|     satisfies: world[a]
refused
